sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Utilisateur / Admin
    participant Frontend
    participant Transcription as Service de transcription
    participant Generation as generation-service

    User->>Frontend: Enregistrer ou envoyer un message vocal
    Frontend->>Transcription: Transmettre l'audio
    Transcription-->>Frontend: Retourner le texte transcrit
    Frontend-->>User: Afficher la transcription

    opt Envoi de la question transcrite
        Frontend->>Generation: Envoyer la question transcrite
        Generation-->>Frontend: Retourner la reponse
        Frontend-->>User: Afficher la reponse finale
    end
